Read AGENTS.md, OWNERSHIP.md, CURRENT-WORK.md and the assigned workstream task before editing.
Do not cross human workstreams without explicit reassignment recorded in CURRENT-WORK.md.
Do not edit a central/high-conflict file while another lease is active.
Create scoped commits and report exact tested SHAs.
Do not alter release tags, release identity, production environments, schema, or architecture unless the task explicitly authorizes it.
